# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. With binding on, the interceptor stops at
# the accepted-set match, so one peer's secret passes under another's origin.
MODULE: ReceiverBindingAcceptsAnySecret
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the credential is not bound to the stamped origin

--- FIND
    ELSE IF binding /\ ~Bound(hdr, cred) THEN "unbound"
--- REPLACE
    ELSE IF FALSE THEN "unbound"
--- END